      "text": "3. Put some oil in a wok and fry the rempah until it becomes fragrant."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Add the lemongrass, tomatoes, and sugar."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Cook for 2-3 minutes until it becomes a thick paste."
